    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Artificial Extinction 2</strong> is a one-of-a-kind hybrid of <strong>first-person shooter</strong>, <strong>real-time strategy</strong>, and <strong>tower defense</strong> \u2014 developed over four years by a solo developer as a passion project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a sentient AI fighting for survival on a hostile Earth ruled by a genocidal machine intelligence. Switch seamlessly between <strong>RTS command view</strong> to build and manage your base, and <strong>FPS mode</strong> to engage enemies directly in brutal front-line combat. Only by mastering both perspectives can you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/7cc7bd3b0e7f0efbc5398913887d9335.poster.avif?t=1754073999\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/7cc7bd3b0e7f0efbc5398913887d9335.webm?t=1754073999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/7cc7bd3b0e7f0efbc5398913887d9335.mp4?t=1754073999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission is simple: <strong>defend your base until critical data decrypts</strong>, then summon your mothership and escape. But the enemy is relentless \u2014 and your survival depends on smart planning, fast thinking, and deadly accuracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/d26dd476054a2f46f9d70194bf45399a.poster.avif?t=1754073999\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/d26dd476054a2f46f9d70194bf45399a.webm?t=1754073999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/d26dd476054a2f46f9d70194bf45399a.mp4?t=1754073999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Core Gameplay Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Seamless Hybrid Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Switch instantly between tactical top-down RTS and immersive FPS combat. Neither mode alone is enough to win.<br>\u2022 <strong>Deep Base Building</strong> \u2013 Construct and upgrade your base using a network of power generators, miners, and 8 types of turret guns.<br>\u2022 <strong>Resource Management</strong> \u2013 Mine metal, uranium, and thorium; generate energy; and manage turret ammo consumption in real time.<br>\u2022 <strong>Tech Tree Progression</strong> \u2013 Build a Quantum Computer to unlock new FPS weapons and turret upgrades through a tech tree system.<br>\u2022 <strong>Advanced AI Enemies</strong> \u2013 Fight 8 unique Mech types, robotic soldiers, combat drones, and airborne enemies with varied, deadly weapons.<br>\u2022 <strong>Support Systems</strong> \u2013 Deploy a powerful military drone and activate long-range artillery to thin out waves from a distance.<br>\u2022 <strong>Dynamic Maps &amp; Replayability</strong> \u2013 Procedural elements like enemy attack paths, resource node placement, and base locations change each playthrough.<br>\u2022 <strong>Score &amp; Leaderboards</strong> \u2013 Compete for survival time on global Steam leaderboards across every level and unlocked game mode.<br>\u2022 <strong>Game Modes</strong> \u2013 Unlock special challenges like:<br>\u2003\u2003\u2022 Nightmare Mode<br>\u2003\u2003\u2022 FPS-Only Mode<br>\u2003\u2003\u2022 RTS-Only Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/7cacad636cbe8835d31baa3d3399f67e.poster.avif?t=1754073999\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/7cacad636cbe8835d31baa3d3399f67e.webm?t=1754073999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/7cacad636cbe8835d31baa3d3399f67e.mp4?t=1754073999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Campaign &amp; Replayability:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game includes <strong>10 handcrafted levels</strong>, each with distinct terrain and tactical challenges. Replay each level to face new enemy attack patterns, resource layouts, and survival challenges. Every victory unlocks new ways to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Built by One Dev. Designed for Strategy Fans.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game was made from the ground up by a solo developer who spent four years crafting a unique experience\u2014built around the kind of game he always wanted to play but could never find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're into <strong>tactical decision-making</strong>, <strong>intense FPS combat</strong>, or <strong>tower defense strategy</strong>, <i>Artificial Extinction 2</i> delivers a fresh, high-stakes battle every time you play.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Artificial Extinction 2</strong> is a one-of-a-kind hybrid of <strong>first-person shooter</strong>, <strong>real-time strategy</strong>, and <strong>tower defense</strong> \u2014 developed over four years by a solo developer as a passion project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a sentient AI fighting for survival on a hostile Earth ruled by a genocidal machine intelligence. Switch seamlessly between <strong>RTS command view</strong> to build and manage your base, and <strong>FPS mode</strong> to engage enemies directly in brutal front-line combat. Only by mastering both perspectives can you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/7cc7bd3b0e7f0efbc5398913887d9335.poster.avif?t=1754073999\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/7cc7bd3b0e7f0efbc5398913887d9335.webm?t=1754073999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/7cc7bd3b0e7f0efbc5398913887d9335.mp4?t=1754073999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission is simple: <strong>defend your base until critical data decrypts</strong>, then summon your mothership and escape. But the enemy is relentless \u2014 and your survival depends on smart planning, fast thinking, and deadly accuracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/d26dd476054a2f46f9d70194bf45399a.poster.avif?t=1754073999\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/d26dd476054a2f46f9d70194bf45399a.webm?t=1754073999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/d26dd476054a2f46f9d70194bf45399a.mp4?t=1754073999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Core Gameplay Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Seamless Hybrid Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Switch instantly between tactical top-down RTS and immersive FPS combat. Neither mode alone is enough to win.<br>\u2022 <strong>Deep Base Building</strong> \u2013 Construct and upgrade your base using a network of power generators, miners, and 8 types of turret guns.<br>\u2022 <strong>Resource Management</strong> \u2013 Mine metal, uranium, and thorium; generate energy; and manage turret ammo consumption in real time.<br>\u2022 <strong>Tech Tree Progression</strong> \u2013 Build a Quantum Computer to unlock new FPS weapons and turret upgrades through a tech tree system.<br>\u2022 <strong>Advanced AI Enemies</strong> \u2013 Fight 8 unique Mech types, robotic soldiers, combat drones, and airborne enemies with varied, deadly weapons.<br>\u2022 <strong>Support Systems</strong> \u2013 Deploy a powerful military drone and activate long-range artillery to thin out waves from a distance.<br>\u2022 <strong>Dynamic Maps &amp; Replayability</strong> \u2013 Procedural elements like enemy attack paths, resource node placement, and base locations change each playthrough.<br>\u2022 <strong>Score &amp; Leaderboards</strong> \u2013 Compete for survival time on global Steam leaderboards across every level and unlocked game mode.<br>\u2022 <strong>Game Modes</strong> \u2013 Unlock special challenges like:<br>\u2003\u2003\u2022 Nightmare Mode<br>\u2003\u2003\u2022 FPS-Only Mode<br>\u2003\u2003\u2022 RTS-Only Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/7cacad636cbe8835d31baa3d3399f67e.poster.avif?t=1754073999\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/7cacad636cbe8835d31baa3d3399f67e.webm?t=1754073999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570450/extras/7cacad636cbe8835d31baa3d3399f67e.mp4?t=1754073999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Campaign &amp; Replayability:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game includes <strong>10 handcrafted levels</strong>, each with distinct terrain and tactical challenges. Replay each level to face new enemy attack patterns, resource layouts, and survival challenges. Every victory unlocks new ways to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Built by One Dev. Designed for Strategy Fans.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game was made from the ground up by a solo developer who spent four years crafting a unique experience\u2014built around the kind of game he always wanted to play but could never find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're into <strong>tactical decision-making</strong>, <strong>intense FPS combat</strong>, or <strong>tower defense strategy</strong>, <i>Artificial Extinction 2</i> delivers a fresh, high-stakes battle every time you play.</p>",
